      "korean": [
        "기쁨",
        "당황",
        "불안",
        "중립"
      ]
    },
    "output": "LogSoftmax -- same as the original model. Backend applies F.softmax() or .exp() (identical: softmax is shift-invariant and log_softmax subtracts a per-row constant). See spec §5 note."
